    "outcome": "By implementing this solution, we ensured that only the final gold assistant span is scored, with the greeting and history serving as context only. This aligned our SFT process with sipagent turn ownership, preventing the model from learning and reinforcing the re-greeting behavior. As a result, we avoided wasting significant GPU resources\u2014estimated at hours to days per bad training recipe\u2014by preventing unnecessary retraining on flawed data.",
