    "opening": "In one of my recent projects, I tackled a significant issue involving our AI's dialogue capabilities. The AI was generating responses that promised actions it couldn't fulfill, like booking appointments or checking calendars. This was crucial to address because it could lead to user frustration and mistrust in our system.",
    "situation": "The problem arose when our AI, powered by LoRA, began generating responses that suggested it could perform CRM or booking tasks. However, these capabilities were not supported by our system, which only allowed for simple actions like transferring calls or sending messages. This disconnect between what the AI promised and what it could actually do was misleading to users.",
