    "outcome": "As a result of these efforts, we were able to reclassify major defects and block problematic response patterns before they could contaminate our training data. This proactive approach saved us from potentially having to regenerate a full golden file and retrain the model, which would have required approximately 4.5 hours of GPU time. This not only saved time but also preserved the integrity of our training data.",
