    "situation": "We discovered that some of our gold-standard utterances included scene-label phrases before the caller actually spoke them. This issue was flagged by our detectors as clairvoyance, which compromised the integrity of our human gold rank and training targets. If left unchecked, this would result in inaccurate Mode C scores and models that learned to predict speech omnisciently.",
