    "subtitle": "Eval set never enters the mixture",
    "opening": "In one of my recent projects, I tackled a critical issue in our model evaluation process for the early receptionist LoRA. The integrity of our evaluation metrics was at stake, and ensuring a fair comparison was essential for reliable model deployment.",
