    "approach": "To address this, I mirrored the sipagent layout by maintaining a stable system and history while moving `open_now`, state, and `call_elapsed_ms` information to the user turn using `[skillset_runtime_context]`. I documented the wire shape from sipagent facts and enforced this structure in Mode C, ensuring that offline evaluation used the same prompt dialect as live scenarios. This approach allowed us to maintain consistency across training, Mode C, and serving environments, claiming \"same factory, gold-locked inputs.\"",
